    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37595" root="لحب" body-key="l">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَحْبٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَاحِبٌ</span></b>  (S, K: the latter word of
the measure <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَاعِلٌ</span> in the sense of the measure
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَفْعُولٌ</span>: i. e. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَلْحُوبٌ</span>: S) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُلَحَّبٌ</span></b>  (K) A
<i>conspicuous</i> road: (S, K:) a <i>wide, extended,</i>
road, <i>that is not interrupted.</i> (TA.)

